  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flight Delay Management Phase II Operational Capacity &amp; System Efficiency, through U.S. Chamber of Commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a Flight Delay Management Technical Assistance Program for the Civil Aviation Administration of China (CAAC). The project, developed in close cooperation with the Federal Aviation Administration (FAA), is assisting CAAC&apos;s Air Traffic Management Bureau (ATMB) to develop a systematic approach to assess factors that influence operational efficiency and capacity at the local, regional, and national system levels, as well as to integrate airport planning with air carrier operations and air traffic procedures.</narrative>
  </description>
